@startuml TelemetryReadFlow
title Telemetry Read Flow Code Diagram

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
left to right direction

package "Legacy Monolith" {
  class SensorHandler {
    +GetSensors()
  }

  class TelemetryClient {
    +GetLatestReadings()
  }
}

package "Telemetry Service" {
  class TelemetryController {
    +GetLatestTelemetry()
  }

  class TelemetryApplicationService {
    +LoadLatestTelemetry()
  }

  class TemperatureProviderAdapter {
    +FetchCurrentValues()
  }

  class TelemetryRepository {
    +SaveReadings()
    +LoadLastKnownValues()
  }

  class TelemetryNormalizer {
    +Normalize()
  }
}

class TemperatureAPI {
  +GET /temperature/{sensorId}
}

database TelemetryStore

SensorHandler --> TelemetryClient : requests latest readings
TelemetryClient --> TelemetryController : HTTPS/JSON
TelemetryController --> TelemetryApplicationService : delegates
TelemetryApplicationService --> TemperatureProviderAdapter : fetches fresh values
TelemetryApplicationService --> TelemetryRepository : reads fallback / stores history
TelemetryApplicationService --> TelemetryNormalizer : normalizes readings
TemperatureProviderAdapter --> TemperatureAPI : HTTPS call
TelemetryRepository --> TelemetryStore : SQL

@enduml
